 "remarks": "Renovated fifth-floor studio in the Hyde Park elevator building with open layout and north and east treetop views. Strong investment opportunity with rentals permitted and a proven rental history. Updates include new wide-plank light wood flooring and fresh neutral paint. The kitchen features white shaker cabinets, dark countertops, and stainless steel appliances (gas range, refrigerator, and dishwasher). Walk-in closet plus additional shelved storage closet. Secure building with renovated lobby and hallways, elevator, on-site gym, and laundry just steps away. Gas heat and reserved garage parking space #12 included. Heat and hot water covered in common charges. Convenient to Springdale Metro-North, shops, cafes, Mianus River Park, downtown Stamford, I-95, and the Merritt Parkway.",
